@title Building permit routing
@subtitle Whitcombe City planning office · Current as of 2026-10-01

## Routing flow
diagram permit title="Building permit routing"
permit: recv "Application received" svc
permit: complete "Submission complete?" decision
permit: ret "Return to applicant" svc
permit: value "Project value over 50000 dollars?" decision
permit: fast "Fast-track review" svc
permit: historic "In a historic district?" decision
permit: heritage "Heritage Board review" svc
permit: plan "Plan review" svc
permit: issued "Permit issued" svc
permit: recv -> complete
permit: complete -> ret : no
permit: complete -> value : yes
permit: value -> fast : no
permit: value -> historic : yes
permit: historic -> heritage : yes
permit: historic -> plan : no
permit: heritage -> plan : cleared
permit: fast -> issued : approved
permit: plan -> issued : approved

## Review times
- Completeness check: 2 business days
- Fast-track review: 3 business days
- Plan review: 15 business days
- Heritage Board review: 30 days, added on top of the plan review time

## Fees
- Base fee: $180 for every application
- Plus 0.8 percent of the project value above $50,000
